# Logo lock

Canonical brand file: [`assets/images/logo.png`](assets/images/logo.png).

- Do not delete, rename, overwrite, convert, regenerate, or download over this file.
- Do not swap it for `logo.svg`, an ECLBET CDN logo, or a generated mark.
- Header, sidebar, footer, and auth pages must use `assets/images/logo.png`.
- `scripts/download-eclbet-assets.js` must never list this path as a download destination.

```html
<!-- GOOD -->
<img src="assets/images/logo.png" alt="ELBET" />

<!-- BAD -->
<img src="assets/images/logo.svg" alt="ELBET" />
```
